<title>USA: National Wireless to sell TV unit.</title>
<headline>National Wireless to sell TV unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Wireless Holdings Inc said Wednesday it has entered into a non-binding letter of intent to sell its South Florida television subsidiary to BellSouth Corp for $48 million in stock.</p>
<p>The transaction is subject to further negotiations. National Wireless said there are no assurances the deal will be completed.</p>
<p>The company declined to disclose further details.</p>
<p>National Wireless is a holding company for wireless cable systems.</p>
</text>
